# GitHub Actions expressions are not URLs. lychee scans workflow files as plain
# text, so a templated download URL such as
#   https://github.com/koalaman/shellcheck/releases/download/v${{ matrix.version }}/...
# is harvested with the expression stripped, leaving a literal "v$" path that
# 404s. The links are correct once Actions expands them; only the pre-expansion
# text is unresolvable.
^https://github\.com/koalaman/shellcheck/releases/download/v\$
^https://github\.com/hadolint/hadolint/releases/download/v\$
